      "message": "test(app): a moved, deleted or shallower rough stales the finish it credits\n\nPR #153 review: S1's retracts are credited by R1 turned ahead of it\n(#159), so R1 is an input of S1's verdict - R1 reordered after S1,\ndeleted, or re-cut shallower marks S1 Stale and the post refuses\n(a_rough_moved_after_deleted_or_made_shallower_stales_its_finish).\nThe flanged bar's rough/finish pair is shared by a helper so the suite\nstays near its size budget.\n\na_finish_posted_ahead_of_its_rough_is_convicted_by_name now makes P1\nbefore R1: R1 runs behind P1 and digests it (#109), so made the other\nway round R1 read Stale and the post refused it before reaching P1's\nrapid.\n\nRefs #109\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
